    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Tests {@link UtcInstant#ofModifiedJulianDay(long, long)} for the final nanosecond of a day that ends with a leap second. <p>1972-12-31 was a leap-second day (Modified Julian Day 41682). Such a day runs for one extra second, so it spans {@code (86400 + 1)} seconds instead of the usual 86400. This test builds the instant at the very last nanosecond of that leap day and verifies that the factory preserves the leap second rather than rolling over into the next day."
